  With a tsurugi's power, it will be easy to neutralize most conventional weaponry, as well as to incapacitate infantry without killing them. I don't know if it will be so easy to do the same against another musha, but if I can at least show myself a difficult opponent, it might be possible to convince the enemy to negotiate.

